Third-party code statically linked into the herdr binary, for aarch64-apple-darwin and x86_64-unknown-linux-gnu:
242 Rust crates (from herdr's Cargo.lock via cargo metadata; dev-only crates left out) and
vendored libghostty-vt and portable-pty.
Each crate is listed with its licence and the copyright lines from its own licence files; then
every distinct licence text, verbatim, with the crates that ship it.
11 crate(s) ship no licence file; their authors are listed instead.
